.sp-50 {
    width: 100%;
    height: 50px;
}

.sp-10 {
    width: 100%;
    height: 10px;
}

.el-shl-loading {
    background-image: url("shl-loading.gif");
}
"""
print(extractCSSInfo(css_content))
```

The `extractCSSInfo` function uses regular expressions to parse the input CSS content and extract the class names and their associated properties. It iterates through the matches to build a dictionary mapping each class to its properties and returns the resulting CSS information.

